(323, 1, 'LFGKT49002', 'ai', 'Baik, permintaan utama Anda sudah saya catat, sebagai berikut 📝 🔥\n\n✓ Rencana: *Sewa*\n✓ Tipe: *Apartemen*\n✓ Lokasi: *Surabaya*\n✓ Budget: *Terjangkau*\n✓ Masuk: *24 Agustus 2026*\n✓ Penghuni: *3 orang*\n✓ Durasi: *12 hari*\n✓ Furnitur: *Semi-furnished*\n✓ Patokan lokasi: *Dekat Ngagel*\n✓ Area alternatif: *Tidak mau*\n✓ Red flags: *Tidak banjir, Akses jalan lancar, Menghindari lokasi panas*\n\nSaya akan segera menghubungi Anda dengan rekomendasi properti yang paling sesuai! 🏠\n\nBerikut pilihan apartemen di Surabaya yang tersedia dari katalog saya:\n\n1. *Surabaya Near Mall Apartment Rent*\n   Lokasi: SURABAYA\n   Harga: *2.2 juta/bulan*\n   Tipe: apartemen - sewa\n   Luas: bangunan 277 m², tanah -\n   Fasilitas: WI-FI, GYM, KOLAM RENANG, CCTV 24 JAM\n\n2. *Surabaya Heritage Zone Apartment Rent*\n   Lokasi: SURABAYA\n   Harga: *2.6 juta/bulan*\n   Tipe: apartemen - sewa\n   Luas: bangunan 119 m², tanah -\n   Fasilitas: PARKING, PILATES STATION, WI-FI, AC, SECURITY, YOGA, CCTV 24 JAM\n\n3. *Surabaya Green Zone Apartment Rent*\n   Lokasi: SURABAYA\n   Harga: *3.1 juta/bulan*\n   Tipe: apartemen - sewa\n   Luas: bangunan 203 m², tanah -\n   Fasilitas: GYM, SECURITY, PILATES STATION, PARKING, KOLAM RENANG\n\n4. *Surabaya Suburban Area Apartment Rent*\n   Lokasi: SURABAYA\n   Harga: *3.7 juta/bulan*\n   Tipe: apartemen - sewa\n   Luas: bangunan 331 m², tanah -\n   Fasilitas: BALCONY, LIFT, KOLAM RENANG, PILATES STATION, SECURITY\n\nMau saya bantu pilihkan yang paling sesuai budget Anda?', 'whatsapp', '{\"aiProvider\":\"chatgpt\",\"contextSource\":\"db_catalog\"}', '2026-08-03 06:13:22', '2026-08-03 06:13:22', NULL, NULL),
(324, 1, 'LFGKT49002', 'customer', 'SELECT\n	prop.`property_id`\n	, prop.`city_id`\n	, prop.`province_id`\n	, prop.`country_id`\n	, prop.`user_id`\n	, prop.`title`\n	, prop.`description`\n	, prop.`price`\n	, prop.`price_type`\n	, prop.`address`\n	, prop.`area`\n	, prop.`district`\n	, prop.`postal_code`\n	, prop.`furnished_status`\n	, prop.`bed_rooms`\n	, prop.`bath_rooms`\n	, prop.`electricity_capacity`\n	, prop.`building_area`\n	, prop.`land_area`\n	, prop.`floor_location`\n	, prop.`floor_quantity`\n	, CASE prop.kpr_status\n		WHEN \'Y\' THEN \'Yes\'\n		WHEN \'N\' THEN \'No\'\n		ELSE \'\'\n	END AS kpr_status\n	, prop.`building_type`\n	, prop.`transaction_type`\n	, prop.`status`\n	, usr.`name` AS \"Agent_Name\"\n	, city.`name` AS \"City_Name\"\n	, prov.`name` AS \"Province_Name\"\n	, cntry.`name` AS \"Country_Name\"\n	, GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT fac.name ORDER BY fac.name SEPARATOR \', \') AS facilities\n	, GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT loc.name ORDER BY loc.name SEPARATOR \', \') AS locations\nFROM\n	`properties` prop\nINNER JOIN `users` usr ON\n	usr.`user_id` = prop.`user_id`\nINNER JOIN `cities` city ON\n	city.`city_id` = prop.`city_id`\n	AND city.`province_id` = prop.`province_id`\n	AND city.`country_id` = prop.`country_id`\nINNER JOIN `provinces` prov ON\n	prov.`province_id` = city.`province_id`\n	AND prov.`country_id` = city.`country_id`\nINNER JOIN `countries` cntry ON\n	cntry.`country_id` = prov.`country_id`\nLEFT JOIN property_facilities AS prop_fac ON\n	prop_fac.property_id = prop.property_id\nLEFT JOIN facilities AS fac ON\n	fac.facility_id = prop_fac.facility_id\nLEFT JOIN property_locations AS prop_loc ON\n	prop_loc.property_id = prop.property_id\nLEFT JOIN locations AS loc ON\n	loc.location_id = prop_loc.location_id\nWHERE\n	prop.`status` = 1\n	AND prop.`user_id` = \'LFGKT49002\'	\n	AND prop.building_type = \'apartemen\'\n	AND prop.transaction_type = \'Rent\'\n	AND prop.price BETWEEN 2000000 AND 5000000\n	AND city.name LIKE \'%Jakarta%\'\n	AND (fac.name LIKE \'%Gym%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%Yoga%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%Kolam%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%renang%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%Kolam renang%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%AC%\'\n		OR fac.name LIKE \'%Pilates%\'\n		OR loc.name LIKE \'%SCBD%\'\n		OR loc.name LIKE \'%pasar%\'\n		OR loc.name LIKE \'%mall%\'\n		OR loc.name LIKE \'%resto%\'\n		OR loc.name LIKE \'%cafe%\'\n	)\nGROUP BY\n	prop.property_id\nORDER BY\n	prop.price\n	, prop.title;', 'whatsapp', '{\"agentName\":\"LEO FELIX\",\"messageId\":\"kirimi_1785745194110\",\"platform\":\"kirimi\"}', '2026-08-03 08:20:06', '2026-08-03 08:20:06', NULL, NULL),
